# Root build context ignore list.
#
# Every root-level Dockerfile (Dockerfile.backend, Dockerfile.bridge,
# Dockerfile.landing, ops/local/*) builds with `context: .`, so without this
# file the ENTIRE repository is packed and shipped to the Docker daemon on
# every build — including .git, two abandoned .git.broken* copies, a Windows
# .venv, node_modules, and the untracked .env full of live production
# credentials.
#
# The COPY statements in those Dockerfiles are selective, so .env never reached
# a published image layer. The problem this file solves is the context transfer
# itself: minutes of wasted build time and secrets handed to the daemon for no
# reason.

# ── Secrets. First, and never removed. ────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
# Re-include the templates AFTER the excludes — order matters here, and
# `**/!.env.example` is not valid negation syntax.
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
!**/*.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
**/secrets/
**/ADMIN_API_KEY*
**/admin_api_key*

# ── VCS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.git.broken
.git.broken2
.github

# ── Dependencies (reinstalled inside the image) ───────────────────────────
node_modules
**/node_modules
.venv
**/.venv
venv
**/venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
.ruff_cache
.pytest_cache
**/.pytest_cache

# ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
*.egg-info

# ── Local tooling / editor state ──────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode
.claude
.agents
.codex
.serena
.idea

# ── Scratch, logs and operator debris ─────────────────────────────────────
# ops/ is full of one-off probe scripts and captured stdout/stderr. None of it
# belongs in a build context. Note the _fix_rls_*.js family MUTATES the
# production database — keeping it out of images is deliberate.
ops/_*
ops/*.log
ops/*.out
ops/*.err
ops/*.png
**/logs/
*.log
legacy/

# ── Tests and docs (not needed at runtime) ────────────────────────────────
**/tests/
**/test_*.py
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# ── OS noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
